      <h1 font-size="42pt">Growth continued; customer expansion became the constraint</h1>
      <p font-size="lg">Revenue rose 6% quarter over quarter and gross margin improved 2 points, but net revenue retention fell to 108%.</p>
      <p>The growth engine is working. Leadership’s task is to fund the intervention, tighten pricing, and rebalance commercial capacity.</p>
